# prepush-worktree-env-scrub drives the two shipping pre-push hooks end to end: it copies each into a
# sandbox repository with a linked worktree, mutates the copies, and runs them. Both are REQUIRED, since a
# run that dropped one would still pass on the other. The runner's sentinel is printed at the point of use.
!.githooks/pre-push
!core/git-hooks/pre-push
# run.sh sources ../lib/preamble.sh first; the runner copies only the fixture's own directory.
core/fixtures/lib/
